Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Simulating the Emergence of Reproductive and Parenting Strategies using \
Agent-Based Modeling with Evolutionary Game Theory\
\>", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821898656762505`*^9, 3.9821898716910725`*^9}, {
  3.9821909533992023`*^9, 
  3.9821909930457573`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fc779f64-94a4-1645-96da-\
b7c48e9320a8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Abstract", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821910469212837`*^9, 3.9821910577482967`*^9}, {
  3.982191106682844*^9, 3.982191126018154*^9}, {3.982191398995737*^9, 
  3.9821914059070625`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b47a9adc-7996-504b-8c35-\
2c9e4daa3d69"],

Cell["We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll work on this during the last couple of \
sprints.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821914125019894`*^9, 
  3.9821914624889736`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"badd546a-7765-9842-941a-\
3decf455c43d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98219114556913*^9, 
  3.9821911516783543`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5932021b-be45-1941-a625-\
9e2664160210"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Merit for Using Agent-Based Modeling (ABM)", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821917929253254`*^9, 3.982191822134247*^9}, {
  3.982192047849478*^9, 3.982192050968609*^9}, {3.9822236412431946`*^9, 
  3.982223644159132*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"add2c244-0246-e442-b31f-\
5aa093a399a0"],

Cell["\<\
Agent Based Modeling is often used to study common behaviors within \
ecosystems because it accurately represents individuals as independent agents \
interacting with their environment through simple rules. Moreover, ABM allows \
for strategies, including reproductive and parenting strategies, to emerge \
naturally from interactions between agents, as opposed to manipulating \
behaviors on a larger scale. This makes it useful for understanding how \
surrounding environments may influence behavioral and evolutionary traits \
within a population.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821923548377037`*^9, 3.9821923578223305`*^9}, {
  3.9821924254536*^9, 3.982192454222889*^9}, {3.982252957448803*^9, 
  3.982252957618307*^9}, {3.982253010011324*^9, 3.982253013322666*^9}, {
  3.98225309762673*^9, 3.982253115418333*^9}, {3.9822531673696823`*^9, 
  3.9822531913914223`*^9}, {3.982253224580414*^9, 3.9822533965534744`*^9}, {
  3.9822534301307144`*^9, 3.982253471459692*^9}, {3.982253541706457*^9, 
  3.9822535443259277`*^9}, {3.9822535900538445`*^9, 3.9822536418586025`*^9}, {
  3.9822538866764374`*^9, 
  3.9822538882600994`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"89c1ddc1-11ec-804e-8dce-\
a5457c40edaa"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Project Roadmap", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821918784106617`*^9, 
  3.982191880814745*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8d4be50a-c105-aa4f-83f5-\
0c9184098e8b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["01 Model Development", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982191944174038*^9, 
  3.982191954872555*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c99bd80f-cd7e-ff43-9397-\
6b30fcaffffb"],

Cell["\<\
In this section, we explain the scope and foundations of our model, including \
how agents, resources (i.e., food), and other environmental parameters are \
represented in ABM.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982192296422554*^9, 3.982192301805994*^9}, {
  3.9821924210804615`*^9, 3.98219242141609*^9}, {3.982192468022743*^9, 
  3.9821924792400494`*^9}, {3.982223512640541*^9, 3.982223517590811*^9}, {
  3.98225368242659*^9, 3.9822538812283287`*^9}, {3.9822539252836857`*^9, 
  3.9822539303379116`*^9}, {3.982253968030327*^9, 
  3.982253993550993*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"af0c5248-afe6-824c-a5b6-\
73ae8b00296f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["02 Constructing the Helper Methods", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821919696805305`*^9, 3.9821919717979717`*^9}, {
  3.9821921741278954`*^9, 
  3.982192180164219*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4f56091e-d7d6-914b-a994-\
f39104a80d4e"],

Cell["\<\
In this section, we explain and develop the helper functions that control \
both the environment and agents within our model. Some methods include \
sensing food, spawning food, incorporating random movement, simulating \
metabolism, and setting up aging. Put together, these form the basic \
mechanics for the simulation.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982192310549799*^9, 3.982192311508625*^9}, {
   3.982192423016836*^9, 3.982192423335232*^9}, {3.98219248122283*^9, 
   3.9821924842230797`*^9}, 3.9822235224087257`*^9, {3.982253948282091*^9, 
   3.9822539561225033`*^9}, {3.9822540167176914`*^9, 3.982254137710886*^9}, {
   3.9822541768982296`*^9, 
   3.9822542551462994`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4ff3d370-32ef-9142-ab33-\
b5bd29176629"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["03 Model Propagation", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821921877297516`*^9, 3.98219220722694*^9}, {
  3.9821922491396313`*^9, 3.9821922538817043`*^9}, {3.9828692070518265`*^9, 
  3.982869216314886*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3a906c76-fc1f-9141-a8fc-\
2cfce4a4caa2"],

Cell["\<\
In this section, we create a timestep update function that incorporates our \
helper methods and allows for the simulation to advance and loop over time. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982192310549799*^9, 3.982192311508625*^9}, {
   3.982192424206501*^9, 3.9821924245291767`*^9}, {3.982192486207096*^9, 
   3.982192489961689*^9}, 3.9822235241291084`*^9, {3.982254324663971*^9, 
   3.982254384079876*^9}, {3.9822556607739334`*^9, 
   3.9822557480500393`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3f2120f9-390f-504d-b435-\
db1e1311ab3c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["04 Visualization", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9828693750684166`*^9, 3.9828693756880836`*^9}, {
  3.9828694146728516`*^9, 
  3.982869416424713*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5e6cb18d-48be-ff4e-8474-\
a4812a744953"],

Cell["05 Implementing Reproduction", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982869382639366*^9, 3.982869382699625*^9}, {
  3.982949287983423*^9, 
  3.98294929552199*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cd86415f-7c3d-0c4e-8aaa-\
b3588059bdbb"],

Cell["06 Reproductive Strategies", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9828693927041187`*^9, 3.9828693930169086`*^9}, {
  3.982949336600586*^9, 3.982949406192724*^9}, {3.982949470293766*^9, 
  3.9829494739939384`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a0751f2c-e66b-3849-b497-\
23d8be64703f"],

Cell["07 Parenting Strategies ", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982869409060692*^9, 3.982869409620863*^9}, {
  3.982949389293644*^9, 3.982949389791912*^9}, {3.9829494777601337`*^9, 
  3.982949482974594*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9a155b4b-f54c-d145-9776-\
d20b91634e16"]
